@api = http://localhost:5100

### Kiem tra may chu - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### Danh sach san pham - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products

### Chi tiet san pham ID 1 - 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### ID khong ton tai - 404, co PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### ID khong phai so - 404, body rong
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### Tao san pham hop le - 201 Created, co Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### Gia am - 400, co INVALID_PRODUCT
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}

### Sai kieu noi dung - 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Lap+trinh+gRPC&price=80000
